# No comments

Do not add comments in code you write or edit.

- No `//` line comments, no `///` docs, no `/* */` blocks.
- This applies to Swift, TypeScript, Python, and scripts.
- If a comment is already there and the task did not ask to document it, leave it alone. If you just added one, delete it.
- Explain non-obvious choices in the chat reply, not in the file.
